</script><section class="page-hero section-wrap" aria-labelledby="page-title"><div class="page-hero-copy"><h1 id="page-title">Mind training, numerology, vastu and astrology</h1><p class="lead">Start with what is on your mind. Narayani brings these practices together around your circumstances and the changes you want to make.</p><div class="cta-row"><a href="/contact/" class="button" data-enquiry="" data-source="services-hero" aria-haspopup="dialog" data-primary-cta="">Enquire about a consultation</a><a class="text-link" href="#how">How a consultation works</a></div></div><div class="page-hero-visual is-late"><nav class="service-mosaic" aria-label="The four services on this page"><a href="#mind-training" class="service-mosaic-card"><div class="mosaic-card-bg"><img src="/images/service-mind-training.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy"/><div class="mosaic-overlay"></div></div><div class="mosaic-card-content"><span class="mosaic-num">01</span><span class="mosaic-title">Mind Training</span></div></a><a href="#numerology" class="service-mosaic-card"><div class="mosaic-card-bg"><img src="/images/service-numerology.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy"/><div class="mosaic-overlay"></div></div><div class="mosaic-card-content"><span class="mosaic-num">02</span><span class="mosaic-title">Numerology</span></div></a><a href="#vastu" class="service-mosaic-card"><div class="mosaic-card-bg"><img src="/images/service-vastu.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy"/><div class="mosaic-overlay"></div></div><div class="mosaic-card-content"><span class="mosaic-num">03</span><span class="mosaic-title">Vastu</span></div></a><a href="#astrology" class="service-mosaic-card"><div class="mosaic-card-bg"><img src="/images/service-astrology.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy"/><div class="mosaic-overlay"></div></div><div class="mosaic-card-content"><span class="mosaic-num">04</span><span class="mosaic-title">Astrology</span></div></a></nav></div></section><nav class="section-chips" aria-label="Services on this page"><div class="section-chips-row section-wrap"><a href="#method" data-chip="method" aria-current="true">Her method</a><a href="#mind-training" data-chip="mind-training">Mind Training</a><a href="#numerology" data-chip="numerology">Numerology</a><a href="#vastu" data-chip="vastu">Vastu</a><a href="#astrology" data-chip="astrology">Astrology</a><a href="#how" data-chip="how">How it works</a><a href="#faq" data-chip="faq">FAQ</a></div></nav><section class="band" id="method" aria-labelledby="method-title"><div class="section-wrap section-space"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="method-title">Mind. Direction. Alignment.</h2><p>Her approach begins with how you think, then connects that understanding to the decisions and habits of everyday life.</p></div><div class="triad"><div class="triad-item"><div class="triad-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 160 120" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-draw="" data-art="mind"><path pathLength="1" d="M14 34C52 34 70 66 98 66" opacity=".45"></path><path pathLength="1" d="M14 50C52 50 70 66 98 66" opacity=".7"></path><path pathLength="1" d="M14 66C52 66 70 66 98 66"></path><path pathLength="1" d="M14 82C52 82 70 66 98 66" opacity=".7"></path><path pathLength="1" d="M14 98C52 98 70 66 98 66" opacity=".45"></path><path pathLength="1" d="M98 66H148" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></div><h3>Mind</h3><p>Understand the thoughts and habits that keep bringing you back to the same place.</p><div class="service-tags"><a href="#mind-training">Mind Training</a></div></div><div class="triad-item"><div class="triad-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-draw="" data-art="direction"><circle pathLength="1" cx="60" cy="62" r="44"></circle><circle pathLength="1" cx="60" cy="62" r="34" opacity=".5"></circle><path pathLength="1" d="M60 24L68 62L60 100L52 62Z"></path><path pathLength="1" d="M60 24L68 62H52Z" opacity=".35"></path><path pathLength="1" d="M60 10v8M60 106v8M8 62h8M104 62h8"></path><circle pathLength="1" cx="60" cy="62" r="3"></circle><path pathLength="1" d="M56 4l4-6 4 6" transform="translate(0 2)"></path></svg></div><h3>Direction</h3><p>Get clear about what matters to you and the next step you want to take.</p><div class="service-tags"><a href="#numerology">Numerology</a><a href="#astrology">Astrology</a></div></div><div class="triad-item"><div class="triad-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-draw="" data-art="alignment"><path pathLength="1" d="M20 96 100 16M86 16h14v14"></path><circle pathLength="1" cx="34" cy="82" r="13"></circle><circle pathLength="1" cx="60" cy="56" r="13"></circle><circle pathLength="1" cx="86" cy="30" r="13"></circle></svg></div><h3>Alignment</h3><p>Bring your daily choices, habits and surroundings into line with that direction.</p><div class="service-tags"><a href="#vastu">Vastu</a></div></div></div></div></section><div class="section-wrap services-showcase-container"><section id="mind-training" class="service-card-luxury" aria-labelledby="mind-training-title"><div class="service-card-visual"><div class="service-card-img-wrap"><img src="/images/service-mind-training.jpg" alt="Mind Training by Narayani Garg" class="service-real-img" width="560" height="460" loading="lazy"/><div class="service-card-badge"><span>Mind &amp; Neural Rewiring</span></div><div class="service-card-num-badge"><span>01</span></div></div></div><div class="service-card-content"><div class="service-card-kicker">Internal Habits &amp; Thought Mastery</div><h2 id="mind-training-title" class="service-card-title">Mind Training</h2><p class="service-card-lead">The habits, beliefs and reactions behind the patterns that keep coming back. Every consultation begins here.</p><figure class="service-card-quote"><blockquote><p>“<!-- -->Couldn’t Krishna have fixed the vastu and ended the war between the brothers? He didn’t. He worked on Arjuna’s mind.<!-- -->”</p></blockquote><figcaption>Narayani Garg · Translated from Hindi</figcaption></figure><div class="service-card-focus-block"><span class="focus-label">What you look at together</span><ul class="service-focus-list"><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>The patterns that keep returning in health, relationships, career or money</span></li><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>How you respond under pressure, and what you tell yourself</span></li><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>Practices from her book: breathwork, affirmations, Ho’oponopono and EFT tapping</span></li><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>Small daily habits that hold a change in place</span></li></ul></div><div class="service-card-cta"><a href="/contact/?topic=Mind%20Training" class="service-enquiry-btn" data-enquiry="" data-topic="Mind Training" data-source="services-mind-training" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span>Enquire about <!-- -->Mind Training</span><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id="numerology" class="service-card-luxury is-reversed" aria-labelledby="numerology-title"><div class="service-card-visual"><div class="service-card-img-wrap"><img src="/images/service-numerology.jpg" alt="Numerology by Narayani Garg" class="service-real-img" width="560" height="460" loading="lazy"/><div class="service-card-badge"><span>Sacred Numerology</span></div><div class="service-card-num-badge"><span>02</span></div></div></div><div class="service-card-content"><div class="service-card-kicker">Name Vibrations &amp; Destiny Numbers</div><h2 id="numerology-title" class="service-card-title">Numerology</h2><p class="service-card-lead">Your date of birth, your name and its spelling, and the numbers you live with every day, read as a starting point for reflection.</p><div class="service-card-focus-block"><span class="focus-label">What you look at together</span><ul class="service-focus-list"><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>Your date of birth, and what it points to</span></li><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>Your name and the way it is spelt</span></li><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>The numbers you live with every day, such as your mobile number</span></li></ul></div><div class="service-card-cta"><a href="/contact/?topic=Numerology" class="service-enquiry-btn" data-enquiry="" data-topic="Numerology" data-source="services-numerology" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span>Enquire about <!-- -->Numerology</span><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id="vastu" class="service-card-luxury" aria-labelledby="vastu-title"><div class="service-card-visual"><div class="service-card-img-wrap"><img src="/images/service-vastu.jpg" alt="Vastu by Narayani Garg" class="service-real-img" width="560" height="460" loading="lazy"/><div class="service-card-badge"><span>Vastu Shastra &amp; Direction</span></div><div class="service-card-num-badge"><span>03</span></div></div></div><div class="service-card-content"><div class="service-card-kicker">Residential &amp; Spatial Harmony</div><h2 id="vastu-title" class="service-card-title">Vastu</h2><p class="service-card-lead">Your home, office or shop, and the way you live and work in it.</p><figure class="service-card-quote"><blockquote><p>“<!-- -->Vastu does not depend on direction. Every direction belongs to God. It depends on the mind.<!-- -->”</p></blockquote><figcaption>Narayani Garg · Translated from Hindi</figcaption></figure><div class="service-card-focus-block"><span class="focus-label">What you look at together</span><ul class="service-focus-list"><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>The layout of your home, office or shop</span></li><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>Where things belong, from the home mandir to family photographs</span></li><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>How the space is used, day to day, by the people in it</span></li></ul></div><div class="service-card-cta"><a href="/contact/?topic=Vastu" class="service-enquiry-btn" data-enquiry="" data-topic="Vastu" data-source="services-vastu" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span>Enquire about <!-- -->Vastu</span><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id="astrology" class="service-card-luxury is-reversed" aria-labelledby="astrology-title"><div class="service-card-visual"><div class="service-card-img-wrap"><img src="/images/service-astrology.jpg" alt="Astrology by Narayani Garg" class="service-real-img" width="560" height="460" loading="lazy"/><div class="service-card-badge"><span>Vedic Astrology</span></div><div class="service-card-num-badge"><span>04</span></div></div></div><div class="service-card-content"><div class="service-card-kicker">Planetary Alignment &amp; Birth Chart</div><h2 id="astrology-title" class="service-card-title">Astrology</h2><p class="service-card-lead">Your birth chart, read around the question you bring, for the larger decisions: career, marriage, property and business.</p><div class="service-card-focus-block"><span class="focus-label">What you look at together</span><ul class="service-focus-list"><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>Your birth chart, read around the question you bring</span></li><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>The larger decisions: career, marriage, property, business</span></li><li><span class="focus-bullet" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>What to do next, and the reason for it</span></li></ul></div><div class="service-card-cta"><a href="/contact/?topic=Astrology" class="service-enquiry-btn" data-enquiry="" data-topic="Astrology" data-source="services-astrology" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span>Enquire about <!-- -->Astrology</span><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section></div><section class="band consultation-journey" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-title"><div class="section-wrap section-space"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="how-title">How a consultation works</h2><p>The team explains the options and fees before you book.</p></div><ol class="steps"><li><span class="list-number">1</span><h3>Reach out</h3><p>Send a WhatsApp message, call, or leave your number for a call back.</p></li><li><span class="list-number">2</span><h3>Share your question</h3><p>Tell the team what is on your mind and what you have already tried.</p></li><li><span class="list-number">3</span><h3>Your consultation</h3><p>With Narayani, online or in person, by appointment.</p></li><li><span class="list-number">4</span><h3>The next step</h3><p>Discuss what to work on next, and whether you would like ongoing guidance.</p></li></ol><div class="consultation-formats"><div class="consultation-format-intro"><span class="kicker">Two ways to meet</span><h3>Choose what suits you.</h3></div><div class="formats"><div class="format"><svg viewBox="0 0 60 60" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-draw="" data-art="online"><rect pathLength="1" x="16" y="4" width="28" height="52" rx="5"></rect><path pathLength="1" d="M26 9h8"></path><path pathLength="1" d="M22 44V29a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v15z"></path><circle pathLength="1" cx="30" cy="50" r="1.6"></circle></svg><div><h3>Online</h3><p>Join from wherever you are. Share your country and time zone when you enquire.</p></div></div><div class="format"><svg viewBox="0 0 60 60" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-draw="" data-art="in-person"><path pathLength="1" d="M6 44V26a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v18M38 44V26a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v18"></path><path pathLength="1" d="M4 44h52M24 38h12M26 38v6M34 38v6"></path></svg><div><h3>In person</h3><p>At her practice, by appointment. The team shares the details when you book.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-wrap section-space" aria-label="A client’s words"><div class="service-quote-showcase"><div class="service-quote-image-wrap"><img src="/images/testimonials/client-0.webp" alt="Deepa K. - Client experience with Narayani Garg" class="service-quote-img" width="380" height="320" loading="lazy"/><div class="service-quote-badge"><span>Client Experience</span></div></div><div class="service-quote-body"><span class="quote-mark-icon" aria-hidden="true">“</span><blockquote class="service-quote-text">“She taught me more than numerology, vastu and remedies. She taught me to believe in myself, and to understand my intuition.”</blockquote><div class="service-quote-author"><strong>Deepa K.</strong><span>Client since 2020 · Translated from Hindi</span></div><div class="service-quote-link-wrap"><a class="text-link" href="/hand-holding-program/">Need more than one conversation? Read about the six-month program →</a></div></div></div></section><section class="faq-wrap has-backdrop" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><svg class="backdrop backdrop-vastu " viewBox="0 0 300 300" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="30" y="30" width="240" height="240" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-width="1.1"></rect><path d="M56.66666666666667 30V270M30 56.66666666666667H270M83.33333333333334 30V270M30 83.33333333333334H270M110 30V270M30 110H270M136.66666666666669 30V270M30 136.66666666666669H270M163.33333333333334 30V270M30 163.33333333333334H270M190 30V270M30 190H270M216.66666666666669 30V270M30 216.66666666666669H270M243.33333333333334 30V270M30 243.33333333333334H270" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-width="0.7" class="sky-faint"></path><rect x="110" y="110" width="80" height="80" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-width="1.1"></rect><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="4" class="sky-ink"></circle><text x="150" y="14" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">N</text><text x="282" y="18" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">NE</text><text x="288" y="150" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">E</text><text x="282" y="284" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">SE</text><text x="150" y="288" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">S</text><text x="18" y="284" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">SW</text><text x="12" y="150" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">W</text><text x="18" y="18" class="sky-direction" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">NW</text></svg><div class="faq section-wrap section-space" id="faq"><div class="faq-intro"><h2 id="faq-title">Before you enquire</h2><p>A few things you may want to know first.</p><a href="/contact/" class="text-link" data-enquiry="" data-source="services-faq" aria-haspopup="dialog">Ask something else</a></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Can one consultation cover more than one area?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Yes. Your question decides the approach, and one conversation can draw on the mind, your numbers, your chart and your surroundings together.</p></details><details><summary>What will I be asked to share?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Only what your question needs: perhaps your full name and date of birth, or the layout of your home. The team tells you before the session.</p></details><details><summary>Does she suggest remedies?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Where a remedy can help, she suggests one that fits your life and explains why. The mind comes first, because a remedy works when the mind does.</p></details><details><summary>Are consultations available outside India?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Yes, online. Mention your country and time zone when you enquire.</p></details><details><summary>What are the consultation and program fees?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Please ask for the current fees when you enquire. The consultation and the six-month program are separate options, and the team explains the scope and the fee before you decide.</p></details><details><summary>Does this replace medical or professional advice?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>No. This is personal and spiritual guidance. It does not replace medical care, mental health treatment, legal advice or financial advice from qualified professionals.</p></details></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="site-footer" id="site-footer"><div class="section-wrap"><div class="footer-cta-box"><div class="footer-cta-text"><h2>Start with one conversation</h2><p>Tell her team what is on your mind.</p></div><div><a href="/contact/" class="button-primary footer-cta-btn" data-enquiry="" data-source="footer" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span>Enquire about a consultation</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="footer-content"><div class="footer-brand"><img src="/images/nng-logo-400.webp" alt="Transformation with NNG